# rfauto citation information (Citation File Format 1.2.0)
# version 字段与 pyproject [project] version 保持同步（改版本时两处一起改）。
# repository-code 与 pyproject project.urls 保持一致（改址时两处一起改）。
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use rfauto in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "rfauto: automated RF/microwave simulation and tuning across HFSS, ADS and openEMS"
type: software
repository-code: "https://github.com/geer1895/rfauto"
authors:
  - name: rfauto developers
version: 0.10.0
license: GPL-3.0-only
abstract: >-
  rfauto is an open framework that automates RF/microwave simulation
  workflows across commercial (HFSS, ADS) and open (openEMS) solvers:
  template-driven model factories, surrogate-assisted optimization,
  multi-fidelity calibration with provenance, and an MCP tool surface
  for LLM agents. All physical numbers are produced by deterministic
  kernels only.
keywords:
  - RF
  - microwave
  - S-parameters
  - simulation
  - optimization
  - calibration
  - multi-fidelity
